Complete bundled spelling dictionary notices (assets/dict/LICENSE-SCOWL.txt)
============================================================================
en_US-scowl-50.txt.gz: English word list for Edit > Check Spelling.
Source: SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented Word Lists) 2020.12.07 by Kevin Atkinson,
http://wordlist.aspell.net/ (downloads.sourceforge.net/project/wordlist/SCOWL/2020.12.07/scowl-2020.12.07.tar.gz).
Built from final/{english,american}-{words,upper,contractions,proper-names,abbreviations}.{10,20,35,40,50}
(size 50, en_US spelling), converted Latin-1 -> UTF-8, possessives ("'s") removed (the checker strips them),
grouped by SCOWL level ("#10", "#20", "#35", "#40", "#50" header lines; each word under the most common level it appears in), sorted within a level, one word per line, gzip -9. 72,403 words.

